  "summary": "Alameda police credited an automated license plate reader with alerting them to a stolen vehicle near South Shore Shopping Center, leading to a traffic stop and arrest. The driver was found with narcotics, burglary tools, multiple vehicle keys, and credit/debit cards belonging to others, and had an outstanding warrant.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "The LPR notified police that a stolen vehicle was near the South Shore Shopping Center and that an officer began a traffic stop after seeing the vehicle.",
